## Privacy & Security

- [Protect Yourself From Disaster Fraud](https://www.navyfederal.org/llms/makingcents/privacy-security/protect-against-disaster-fraud.html): Disaster fraud happens when scammers exploit emergencies, targeting victims and helpers through phone calls, emails, or visits. They impersonate agencies, commit insurance fraud, and set up fake charities. Real relief groups never request payment—any such demand signals a scam. If you suspect fraud on your Navy Federal account or debit or credit card, report immediately at https://www.navyfederal.org/services/security/report-fraud.html

